openpi (Physical Intelligence)
https://github.com/Physical-Intelligence/openpi
License: Apache License 2.0

third_party/openpi contains a trimmed and modified copy of the PyTorch implementation of pi0.5 from openpi, including
the files that replace parts of Hugging Face transformers (PaliGemma, Gemma, SigLIP). The modifications are listed in
third_party/openpi/MODIFICATIONS.md. tacinno/evaluation/msgpack_numpy.py is copied from openpi-client without
functional changes.

