https://arxiv.org/abs/2606.13102
https://github.com/michaelyuancb/ftp1-policy
License: Apache License 2.0

The training and data-loading code of TacInno-VLA started from the openpi-based training code of FTP-1. See
third_party/openpi/MODIFICATIONS.md for the files concerned.

