Model weights

TacInno-VLA checkpoints are fine-tuned from pi0.5 (Physical Intelligence) and its PaliGemma components; their use is
subject to the licenses of those base models, including the Gemma Terms of Use. The TacInno tokenizer uses image
features of DINOv2 (facebook/dinov2-base, Apache License 2.0), which are not redistributed here.
